WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.200
Explore Moonfall Abbey with tokens, transparent progress indicators and the new lower dock.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.700
Prepare sessions, pin documents and manage the campaign before entering the table.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:23.800
Track clocks and reveal staged clues using the same saved campaign records.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:30.000
Connect topics, notes and campaign resources in a mind map.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Organize journal pages in nested chapters, including empty chapters.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.500
Type @ in the journal to insert a reference through the native campaign-resource picker.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.000
Map text, number and checkbox rectangles onto an original flat PDF.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Configure field rolls, token values, formulas and presets in the native modal.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Smart Object nodes connect a gate interaction to clocks, clues and a mind map.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Gravewright 0.3.2 · Your next story starts here. Silent real-interface recording.
